<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1, viewport-fit=cover">
  <title>{{headline}}</title>
  <meta name="description" content="{{dek}}">
  <meta property="og:type" content="article">
  <meta property="og:title" content="{{headline}}">
  <meta property="og:description" content="{{dek}}">
  <meta property="og:image" content="https://domainhound.dev/sf/share.png">
  <meta property="og:image:width" content="1200">
  <meta property="og:image:height" content="630">
  <meta property="og:image:alt" content="{{shareAlt}}">
  <meta property="og:url" content="https://domainhound.dev/sf/">
  <meta name="twitter:card" content="summary_large_image">
  <link rel="canonical" href="https://domainhound.dev/sf/">
  <link rel="icon" href="/assets/hound-mark.svg" type="image/svg+xml">
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="/assets/home.css">
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="/sf/palette.css">
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="/sf/page.css">
  <script type="module" src="/sf/page.mjs"></script>

</head>
<body>
<header><div class="frame mast">
  <a class="paper-art" href="/" aria-label="Domain Hound home">
    <span class="paper-dog"><img src="/assets/hound-mark.svg" width="180" height="180" alt=""></span>
  </a>
</div></header>
<main>
  <section class="intro"><div class="frame spread">
    <div><p class="eyebrow">SF startups · YC directory · {{edition}}</p>
      <h1><span>{{lead}}</span> <span>{{subhead}}</span></h1>
      <p class="lede">{{dek}}</p>
    </div>
    <section class="ticket" aria-labelledby="leaders-title">
      <div class="ticket-top"><h2 id="leaders-title">The top 3</h2></div>
      <ol id="leaders">{{leaders}}</ol>
      <svg class="postcard-scene" viewBox="0 0 400 110" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false">
        <defs>
          <g id="gate-span" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linejoin="round">
            <!-- The nearer tower and deck sit higher in the perspective view. -->
            <path d="M-4 77Q37 69 97 12Q167 112 279 44Q326 87 404 87" stroke-width="2.6"/>
            <path d="M18 71v14m19-24v24m19-37v37m20-54v54m42-48v49m18-32v33m19-23v24m19-19v19m19-16v17m19-18v18m20-22v23m19-30v30m17-40v41m30-28v29m18-18v19m19-12v13m20-9v9m21-5v6" stroke-width="1.5"/>
            <path d="M-4 84l408 10" stroke-width="5"/>
            <path d="M90 101l3-94h3l-1 94zm12 0l-2-94h3l4 94zm171 0l3-63h2l-1 63zm9 0l-2-63h2l4 63z" fill="currentColor" stroke-width="1.4"/>
            <path d="M94 14h7m-7 7h7m-8 16h9m-10 16h11m-11 17h12m172-26h6m-7 9h8m-8 12h8m-9 13h10" stroke-width="3"/>
          </g>
        </defs>
        <path fill="var(--mist)" d="M0 0h400v110H0z"/>
        <circle cx="331" cy="30" r="18" fill="var(--leaf)"/>
        <path fill="var(--mint)" d="M0 60q30-14 59-9t52 5q25-1 53-12t55-6q30 6 55 24t57 9q40-13 69-8v47H0z"/>
        <path fill="var(--paper)" d="M0 67h70q8 0 8 3t-8 3H0zm180-7h74q7 0 7 2.5t-7 2.5h-74q-6 0-6-2.5t6-2.5z"/>
        <use href="#gate-span"/>
        <path fill="currentColor" d="M0 76q16 0 34 9l32 17q8 4 17 8H0zm400 7q-23 0-44 10t-50 17h94z"/>
      </svg>
    </section>
  </div></section>
  <div class="ranking-band"><div class="frame ranking-spread">
    <section class="reason"><h2>Why they skipped it</h2>
      <strong>{{takenPct}}</strong>
      <p>For {{registered}} of the {{nonCom}} startups on other endings, the matching .com is already registered today.</p>
      <p>Getting a taken .com means buying it from the owner, at the owner’s price.</p>
    </section>
    <section><h2>The top 10 endings</h2><ol id="ranking">{{ranking}}</ol></section>
  </div></div>
  <section class="examples-band"><div class="frame">
    <h2>Real startups, other endings</h2>
    <div class="examples">{{groups}}</div>
  </div></section>
  <section class="chart-band"><div class="frame">
    <h2>.ai is rising</h2>
    <p class="deck">1 in 5 in early 2023. 1 in 3 today.</p>
    <div class="legend"><span><i class="com"></i>.com</span><span><i class="ai"></i>.ai</span><span><i class="rest"></i>Other endings</span></div>
    <div class="plot">
      <div class="axis" aria-hidden="true"><span>100%</span><span>50%</span><span>0%</span></div>
      <div class="years">{{bars}}</div>
    </div>
    <div class="batch-readout"><select aria-label="YC batch" id="batch-select" disabled>{{options}}</select></div>
    <table class="batch-details" aria-label="Top 5 endings"><tbody aria-live="polite">{{tableRows}}</tbody></table>
    <div id="batch-templates" hidden>{{batchTemplates}}</div>
  </div></section>
  <section class="facts-band"><div class="frame">
    <h2>Behind the dot</h2>
    <div class="cards">
      <article><p><strong>{{compound}}</strong> names are two words glued together.</p></article>
      <article><p><strong>{{prefixed}}</strong> put “get” or “try” in front of the name.</p></article>
      <article><p>Shortest: <b>{{shortestDomain}}</b>. Longest: <b>{{longestDomain}}</b>.</p></article>
    </div>
  </div></section>
  <section class="choice-band"><div class="frame choice">
    <h2>How to choose</h2>
    <ol><li><span aria-hidden="true" class="step">1.</span> <span>Your exact name on .com at the normal price? Take it.</span></li>
      <li><span aria-hidden="true" class="step">2.</span> <span>Taken? Pick the ending that says what you do: .ai, .dev or .io.</span></li>
      <li><span aria-hidden="true" class="step">3.</span> <span>Keep the exact name. A short ending beats a long .com.</span></li>
      <li><span aria-hidden="true" class="step">4.</span> <span>Check app stores and trademarks before you buy.</span></li></ol>
  </div></section>
  <section id="check" class="check-band"><div class="frame">
    <h2 id="check-title">Check your name</h2>
    <p>Domain, cheapest shop with renewal, app stores and trademarks. Free.</p>
    <form id="check-form" action="/" autocomplete="off"><div class="field">
      <input id="candidate" name="q" type="text" maxlength="253" required pattern=".*\S.*" aria-labelledby="check-title" autocapitalize="none" spellcheck="false">
      <button type="submit">Check my name</button>
    </div></form>
  </div></section>
  <section class="method"><div class="frame">
    <h2>Method</h2>
    <p>One site per Bay Area YC startup, {{first}} to {{latest}}; {{excluded}} had none. .com status from Verisign RDAP on {{checked}}, matched on the brand’s letters and digits. Who owns each .com, and what was free at launch, is not known.</p>
    <p>Sources: <a href="{{source}}">Directory snapshot</a> · <a href="https://rdap.verisign.com/com/v1/help">Verisign RDAP</a> · <a href="https://publicsuffix.org/list/">Public Suffix List</a> · <a href="https://www.nltk.org/howto/wordnet.html">WordNet</a></p>
  </div></section>
</main>
<footer><div class="frame"><p>Not affiliated with Y Combinator. <a href="https://www.ycombinator.com/companies">Data from YC's public directory.</a> · <a href="/privacy/">Privacy</a></p></div></footer>
</body>
</html>
